flowchart TD
    T[Task] --> C[Context Builder]
    E[Event refs] --> C
    K[Knowledge exact versions] --> C
    S[Skill exact versions] --> C
    A[Artifacts] --> C
    TD[Tool definitions] --> C
    C --> M[ExecutionContextManifest persisted]
    M --> X[AgentExecution]
    X --> TI[Tool Invocation]
    TI --> R{Known deterministic recovery?}
    R -->|Yes| DR[Bounded deterministic recovery]
    R -->|No / still failed| TO[ToolOutcome]
    DR --> TO
    TO --> X
